@base = http://localhost:8080
@token = REPLACE_WITH_DEVELOPMENT_TOKEN
@source = REPLACE_WITH_ACCOUNT_GUID
@destination = REPLACE_WITH_ACCOUNT_GUID

### Development only
POST {{base}}/dev/token/alice

### Create source and destination (repeat)
POST {{base}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"currency":"USD"}

### Development-only initial funding, represented in the ledger
POST {{base}}/api/dev/accounts/{{source}}/fund
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount":10000}

### Repeating this exact request replays the same result
POST {{base}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-transfer-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"from":"{{source}}","to":"{{destination}}","amount":2500}

### History
GET {{base}}/api/accounts/{{source}}/history?page=1&size=20&kind=Transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Balance (always SQL)
GET {{base}}/api/accounts/{{source}}/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Async notification receipts
GET {{base}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
